[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふぅ……これで、薬が作れますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whew... Now we can make the medicine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……ああ。ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... Yeah. Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……お父さん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Daddy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、これを飲みなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here, drink this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだか……身体が楽になったみたい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I feel... My body feels so much lighter..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よかった。本当に……効いたんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank goodness. It really... It worked!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さんのおかげだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's all thanks to you, Daddy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ずっと帰ってこなくて寂しかったけど、\nお父さんは、やっぱりすごいね……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was so lonely while you were gone, but you're still amazing, Daddy...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Daddy?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "聞いてくれ……実は",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Listen... The truth is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どんな理由があろうと、\n俺がこの国を危険にさらしたことには変わりない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No matter the reason, I still put this country in danger."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから……これから神官長様の所へ自首しに行くよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So... I'm going to turn myself in to the High Priest."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんな父親で……すまない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry... for being such a terrible father."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Daddy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さんは、君を治すために一生懸命、\n魔物にも立ち向かったんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your father fought so hard against those monsters, all to make you better."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。それが罪を犯すようなことだったとしても、\n君を勇敢に救おうとしたんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. Even if what he did was a crime, he courageously tried to save you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいんだ。俺がやったことは消えやしない。\nただ、娘に情けない思いをさせることだけが――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's fine. What I did can't be undone. I just hate that I have to make my daughter feel ashamed of me—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "情けなくなんかないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm not ashamed of you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さんがどんなことをしたって、\n嫌いになんかなるわけがないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I could never hate you, no matter what you did."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だってお父さんは、いつだってかっこいい\n英雄だもん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because you're my hero, Daddy. You always will be!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "英雄……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A hero..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さん。私のために……本当にありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Daddy, thank you... Thank you for everything you did for me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……ああ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]